  "_comment": "Faithful copy of the canonical astro-docs calendar-month-screen.v0.example.json (BFF contract v0.2.0). Wrapper carries itemType (data axis, calendar.event.v1); presentation.component is the versioned UI component (calendar.event.monthAllDayBar.v1 | calendar.event.monthTimedMarker.v1). Month all-day events render as one filled-bar component; timed events render as a dot marker with a single combined `line` (dot color resolved client-side from the calendars map). Songkran Apr 13-15, Chiang Mai Apr 14-17, Apr 16 overflow day. Drives the :shared contract-parity test; colors illustrative. Keep diffable against the astro-docs source.",
